---
import { nonorthogonalChain } from '../../../data/part04/ch14TeachingModels.mjs';

const componentId = 'ch14-nonorthogonal-chain';
const width = 700;
const height = 320;
const pad = { left: 52, right: 22, top: 24, bottom: 48 };
const defaults = { hopping: -1, overlap: 0.18, onsite: 0 };
const samples = Array.from({ length: 201 }, (_, index) => -Math.PI + 2 * Math.PI * index / 200);
const values = samples.map((k) => nonorthogonalChain({ k, ...defaults }));
const yMin = Math.min(...values.map((item) => item.energy)) - 0.3;
const yMax = Math.max(...values.map((item) => item.energy)) + 0.3;

const toPolyline = (key) => values.map((item, index) => {
  const x = pad.left + index * (width - pad.left - pad.right) / (values.length - 1);
  const value = item[key];
  const y = pad.top + (yMax - value) * (height - pad.top - pad.bottom) / (yMax - yMin);
  return `${x.toFixed(2)},${y.toFixed(2)}`;
}).join(' ');
---

<figure class="chapter-visual nonorth-chain" id={componentId}>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：非正交一维最近邻链</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: a nonorthogonal one-dimensional nearest-neighbour chain</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls nonorth-chain__controls">
    <label>
      <span>hopping t（能量单位）</span>
      <input data-chain-hopping type="range" min="-2" max="-0.2" step="0.1" value={defaults.hopping} />
      <output data-chain-hopping-output>{defaults.hopping.toFixed(1)}</output>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>overlap s（无量纲）</span>
      <input data-chain-overlap type="range" min="-0.45" max="0.45" step="0.01" value={defaults.overlap} />
      <output data-chain-overlap-output>{defaults.overlap.toFixed(2)}</output>
    </label>
  </div>

  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${width} ${height}`} role="img" aria-labelledby={`${componentId}-title ${componentId}-desc`}>
    <title id={`${componentId}-title`}>Nonorthogonal one-band dispersion</title>
    <desc id={`${componentId}-desc`}>The band energy is H of k divided by S of k for a nearest-neighbour chain. The overlap metric remains positive for the allowed overlap range.</desc>
    <line class="plot-axis" x1={pad.left} y1={height - pad.bottom} x2={width - pad.right} y2={height - pad.bottom} />
    <line class="plot-axis" x1={pad.left} y1={pad.top} x2={pad.left} y2={height - pad.bottom} />
    <line class="plot-guide" x1={(width + pad.left - pad.right) / 2} y1={pad.top} x2={(width + pad.left - pad.right) / 2} y2={height - pad.bottom} />
    <polyline class="nonorth-chain__band" data-chain-band points={toPolyline('energy')} />
    <text x={pad.left} y={height - 15} text-anchor="middle">−π</text>
    <text x={(width + pad.left - pad.right) / 2} y={height - 15} text-anchor="middle">0</text>
    <text x={width - pad.right} y={height - 15} text-anchor="middle">π</text>
    <text transform={`translate(17 ${(height + pad.top - pad.bottom) / 2}) rotate(-90)`} text-anchor="middle">energy</text>
    <text x={(width + pad.left - pad.right) / 2} y={height - 2} text-anchor="middle">ka</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span>最小 overlap eigenvalue | minimum metric:</span>
    <strong data-chain-min-metric>{(1 - 2 * Math.abs(defaults.overlap)).toFixed(3)}</strong>
    <span data-chain-state>正定 | positive definite</span>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong><code>H(k)=ε0+2t cos(ka)</code>、<code>S(k)=1+2s cos(ka)</code>、<code>ε(k)=H(k)/S(k)</code>，固定 <code>ε0=0</code>。t 使用任意一致能量单位，s 无量纲。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> <code>H(k)=ε0+2t cos(ka)</code>, <code>S(k)=1+2s cos(ka)</code>, and <code>ε(k)=H(k)/S(k)</code>, with fixed <code>ε0=0</code>. t uses an arbitrary consistent energy unit and s is dimensionless.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>最近邻 metric 对所有 k 正定当且仅当 <code>|s|&lt;1/2</code>；<code>s=0</code> 恢复正交 cosine band。滑块范围限制在正定区间内。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> the nearest-neighbour metric is positive for every k exactly when <code>|s|&lt;1/2</code>; <code>s=0</code> recovers the orthogonal cosine band. The control is restricted to the positive-definite domain.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>这是一个轨道、最近邻、固定参数模型；不计算自洽密度、总能、力、电子关联或真实材料参数。非正交性改变色散，但不自动提升模型精度。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> this is a one-orbital nearest-neighbour fixed-parameter model. It computes no self-consistent density, total energy, force, correlation, or material parameter. Nonorthogonality changes dispersion but does not automatically improve accuracy.</p>
  </div>

  <noscript><p>关闭 JavaScript 后显示 t=−1、s=0.18 的静态正定非正交色散。</p></noscript>
</figure>

<script>
  import { nonorthogonalChain } from '../../../data/part04/ch14TeachingModels.mjs';

  const root = document.getElementById('ch14-nonorthogonal-chain');
  if (root) {
    const hopping = root.querySelector('[data-chain-hopping]');
    const overlap = root.querySelector('[data-chain-overlap]');
    const hoppingOutput = root.querySelector('[data-chain-hopping-output]');
    const overlapOutput = root.querySelector('[data-chain-overlap-output]');
    const metricOutput = root.querySelector('[data-chain-min-metric]');
    const stateOutput = root.querySelector('[data-chain-state]');
    const band = root.querySelector('[data-chain-band]');
    if (
      hopping instanceof HTMLInputElement
      && overlap instanceof HTMLInputElement
      && hoppingOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement
      && overlapOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement
      && metricOutput instanceof HTMLElement
      && stateOutput instanceof HTMLElement
      && band instanceof SVGPolylineElement
    ) {
      const width = 700;
      const height = 320;
      const pad = { left: 52, right: 22, top: 24, bottom: 48 };
      const samples = Array.from({ length: 201 }, (_, index) => -Math.PI + 2 * Math.PI * index / 200);
      const update = () => {
        const t = Number(hopping.value);
        const s = Number(overlap.value);
        const values = samples.map((k) => nonorthogonalChain({ k, hopping: t, overlap: s, onsite: 0 }));
        const energies = values.map((item) => item.energy);
        const yMin = Math.min(...energies) - 0.3;
        const yMax = Math.max(...energies) + 0.3;
        const points = energies.map((energy, index) => {
          const x = pad.left + index * (width - pad.left - pad.right) / (energies.length - 1);
          const y = pad.top + (yMax - energy) * (height - pad.top - pad.bottom) / (yMax - yMin);
          return `${x.toFixed(2)},${y.toFixed(2)}`;
        }).join(' ');
        band.setAttribute('points', points);
        hoppingOutput.value = t.toFixed(1);
        overlapOutput.value = s.toFixed(2);
        const minimumMetric = 1 - 2 * Math.abs(s);
        metricOutput.textContent = minimumMetric.toFixed(3);
        stateOutput.textContent = minimumMetric > 0 ? '正定 | positive definite' : '非正定 | invalid metric';
      };
      hopping.addEventListener('input', update);
      overlap.addEventListener('input', update);
      update();
    }
  }
</script>

<style>
  .nonorth-chain__controls {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(14rem, 1fr));
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }
  .nonorth-chain__controls label { display: grid; gap: 0.35rem; }
  .nonorth-chain input, .nonorth-chain svg { width: 100%; }
  .nonorth-chain svg text { fill: currentColor; font-size: 13px; }
  .nonorth-chain__band { fill: none; stroke: var(--sl-color-accent-high); stroke-width: 2.5; }
  .plot-axis { stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .plot-guide { stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-4); stroke-dasharray: 5 5; }
</style>
